<title>UK: Banque la Henin sets 600 million French franc bond.</title>
<headline>Banque la Henin sets 600 million French franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANQUE LA HENIN</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN FRF   COUPON     5.90	MATURITY    04.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    04.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.70     SPREAD	+50 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A2	  LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
